Third-party work included:

- The Classic theme's dark background,
  themes/classic/dark/apple/Background_LightBlue_Image.png, is the RepriseOS
  core's former themes/dark/background-dark-image.png by lgreitis (5ec8799).
  Its dark palette comes from the core's former payload/dark_mode.c (01c89f6)
  by lgreitis and Alex Ball (alexballvideos-netizen). GPL-3.0-only.

No Apple firmware or artwork ships in this directory. The catalog records the
names, sizes, offsets and checksums of Apple's bitmaps, and Classic's recolour
rules list the colour values they change; neither holds any pixels.
